# Changelog
## [Unreleased]
### Breaking changes
 * `WifiClient` now manages all wifi-phy interfaces in one object; use
   `WifiClient::init()` and the `WifiRunResult`-returning
   `run_multi()` when managing multiple interfaces.

### New features
 - Add per-network `prefered` flag: a preferred SSID found in scan
   results wins over stronger BSSes of other configured SSIDs; it is
   ignored when its signal is below
   `DEFAULT_SWITCH_SSID_LOWER_THAN_DBM` (-80 dBm).
 * One `WifiClient` per network namespace: all interfaces share one
   nl80211 socket and one event dispatcher that routes multicast events
   by `IFINDEX`.
 * Add `NetworkConfig::hints` so API users can pass last-known BSS
   information for a scan-free connect, or partial hints (frequencies)
   for a best-effort quick scan with the normal scan flow as fallback.
   `WifiClient::export_hints()` exports the current BSS as hints for
   the next run.
 * `NetworkConfigHints` and `SecurityType` now implement serde
   `Serialize`/`Deserialize` so hints can be persisted to a file and
   loaded back after reboot.

### Bug fixes
 - Report wrong-password authentication failures as
   `ErrorKind::WrongPassword` on `WifiClient::run()` /
   `WifiRunResult::error` instead of only entering the generic
   `FailedAuthentication` retry state.
 - `SET_REKEY_OFFLOAD` now carries the negotiated AKM instead of always
   reporting SAE.
 - Refresh driver rekey offload after userspace group rekeys and after
   FT roam, and apply the replay counter reported by the driver after a
   firmware GTK rekey.

## [0.2.0] - 2026-08-16
### Breaking changes
 - `WifiConfig` now holds a network list; use `add_network()` instead
   of the removed `ssid`/`password` fields. (05b4466)
 - Signal-triggered roaming is enabled per network by default; the
   global `roam_threshold_dbm` config is replaced by per-network
   `roaming` and `roaming_threshold`. (40fba35)

### New features
 - Support multiple WiFi networks in one scan schedule. (05b4466)
 - Add hardware scheduled scan (PNO) with host scan backoff fallback.
   (6d423c8)
 - Add userspace PMKSA cache for fast reconnection. (60e7404)
 - Add IEEE 802.11r/802.11v roaming support. (afb4278)
 - Add per-SSID signal-triggered roaming, enabled by default. (40fba35)
 - Add CQM-triggered roam scans, background scan and cross-SSID
   critical switch. (d7f5ea7)
 - Quick-scan known ESS frequencies before a full-scan fallback.
   (a4c4242)
 - Request 802.11k Neighbor Reports before quick roam scans. (a955907)
 - Add SAE anti-clogging token handling, HnP fallback and commit
   retransmission. (5aae947)
 - Add WoWLAN suspend support with opt-in `wowlan` config. (f63bb6e)
 - Run one `WifiClient` per configured interface. (504ba1a)
 - Skip unsupported-AKM BSSes and classify disconnect reasons for
   retry backoff. (504ba1a)
 - Add systemd unit, /etc/shuli layout and man page. (7ad6e3a)
 - Add WPA2-PSK-SHA256 (AKM 6) support. (72d0b46)
 - Add EAP transport (RFC 3748) and peer state machine. (545edd2)
 - Add EAP-TLS via rustls (RFC 5216 / RFC 9190). (630b375)
 - Add WPA2-Enterprise (802.1X/EAP-TLS) support. (144d813)
 - Add WPA3-Enterprise baseline (AKM 5, mandatory PMF). (9acb48f)
 - Add wired 802.1X (EAPOL over Ethernet). (16bc427)
 - Add SAE password identifiers. (8bf6f70)
 - Negotiate the BIP group management cipher in the RSNE. (ec6e8cf)
 - Parse and log the Transition Disable KDE. (f6a4622)
 - Add Operating Channel Validation (OCV) support. (044ab39)
 - Add Extended Key ID support. (76a239c)
 - Add SAE-EXT-KEY (AKM 24/25) support. (b2c3aea)
 - Fail cleanly when the AP requires SAE-PK (status 127). (da9df6d)
 - Support connection to hidden SSIDs. (eaaa41b)
 - Expose `WifiClient::current_bssid()`. (4d6e7c4)

### Bug fixes
 - Install IGTK/BIGTK and validate Message 3 IEs for PMF. (959ce70)
 - Wait for the scan-completion event instead of a fixed sleep.
   (eea56d1)
 - Restore the connected state when a roam scan stays. (b4a4db7)
 - Do not switch to a weaker BSS in a roam scan. (ca04d6d)
 - Cancel a pending roam scan when the signal recovers. (473ae27)
 - Reject security downgrades in cross-SSID critical switch. (ed1011b)
 - Fix FT-SAE roam on HnP APs and rejected reassociation handling.
   (64e729a)
 - Clear stale FT context on a new auth attempt. (28ac610)
 - Retry SAE auth on transient 802.11 rejection statuses. (29b8820)
 - Report scan signal in dBm instead of mBm. (75f654f)
 - Check AP scan capabilities before SAE H2E, OCV and Extended Key ID.
   (2cd79a6)
 - Make background scan a low-frequency fallback. (604b67f)
 - Only return from `run()` when the state changes. (d801098)
 - Suppress transient roam scan states from `run()`. (2f12ff9)

